 "npcs": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "raw": "8200022503030006",
   "x": 130,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x25",
   "animPhase": 3,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 6,
   "text": "A moment, Duke Garland. If you listen closely in front of the underground door, you will hear a terrifying sound. That's the entrance to the inferno that is home to the demons. Beware that place, young man."
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "raw": "0900024600020000",
   "x": 9,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x46",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 0,
   "text": "Ah, you are the warrior I've heard about. My son Michael was a courageous warrior. He went into the caverns and was never seen again. Please be careful."
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "raw": "1500834500010001",
   "x": 21,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x45",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 1,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_2nd_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 1,
   "text": "Sir, I dreamed that a demon created the underground caverns and filled them with monsters. Then the Spirits brought you to here to make things right again. Before you go, visit the magic shop -- you'll find many useful things there. Good luck on your quest."
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "raw": "3100000000020002",
   "x": 49,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 2,
   "text": "You're on your way to the caverns, aren't you? I recently went in search of a powerful potion said to be hidden there. I didn't stay long enough to find it, but perhaps you will. Be sure to stop at the weapons shop -- you'll need some strong armor.Duke Garland, they say that a potion is hidden in a wall near a platform that raises and lowers. I&wish you luck."
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "raw": "bc00000001030003",
   "x": 188,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 3,
   "text": "You're going into the caverns? You are a brave man. They say there are many doors underground, but many are locked and the keys are scattered throughout the labyrinths. I hope you can find them."
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "raw": "8200020000020004",
   "x": 130,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 4,
   "text": "Duke Garland, someone I know survived a journey to the underground town, Satono. According to him, the road back is short but the road out is long. It will be very dangerous."
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "raw": "9000841d00010005",
   "x": 144,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 4,
   "headTile": "0x1d",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 1,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_2nd_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 5,
   "text": "According to the legends, the name of the underground town is Satono. "
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "raw": "a000018a00000007",
   "x": 160,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0x8a",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 0,
   "aiName": "look_at_hero_and_bob",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 7,
   "text": "Alas, I fear there is no hope. You and I and all who inhabit this town will surely perish. Don't run off to some terrible place, stay and have a drink with me. Ah, I know you must go, and I salute you -- you're a braver man than I. God be with you."
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "raw": "5600004600020008",
   "x": 86,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x46",
   "animPhase": 0,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 8,
   "text": "When you kill a&monster you get a&thing called 'almas'. It's worth a&lot of money. I'd like to get some myself but I don't want to go down there. "
  }
 ],
